# Google Maps Platform API Key for Vue 3 + Vite
# Copy this file to .env.local and insert your key:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# Quickstart with a free zero-billing Maps Demo Key (prototyping only):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with a Google account (no billing card required) and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Click to generate/reveal your Demo Key, then paste it below.
# Note: For Address Validation API and Maps Static API in production, use a standard Google Cloud
# API key restricted by HTTP referrer and enabled APIs:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
